t;&gt;50571</a><br/>chechens are fucking smelly, but it is generally a great idea<br/>georgian girls are hecking hot</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50583"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50583" id="delete_50583" /><label for="delete_50583"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T04:13:04Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 04:13:04</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50583" onclick="highlightReply(50583)" href="/thread/50550.html#50583">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50583)" href="/thread/50550.html#q50583">50583</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >take the BBCpill</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50641"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50641" id="delete_50641" /><label for="delete_50641"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T22:38:38Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 22:38:38</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50641" onclick="highlightReply(50641)" href="/thread/50550.html#50641">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50641)" href="/thread/50550.html#q50641">50641</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >I bet you're sub 6 foot, I'm slavic and 6'9, slavs are white they are intelligent and have high colored eye rates. H man liked Slovaks and his personal driver Shrek was slovak</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50643"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50643" id="delete_50643" /><label for="delete_50643"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T22:44:42Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 22:44:42</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50643" onclick="highlightReply(50643)" href="/thread/50550.html#50643">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50643)" href="/thread/50550.html#q50643">50643</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >If you're still alive at 70 you will be in memory care with dementia(estrogen increases dementia risk, 2/3 of all people with dementia are female). You will go to the bathroom and look at your science experiment snatch and scream in horror thinking they medically experimented with you, and you will scream "where's my cock!". Please don't burden the medical system, YWNBAW just rope,  you're a useless eater.</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50691"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50691" id="delete_50691" /><label for="delete_50691"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-26T04:32:20Z">02/26/24 (Mon) 04:32:20</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50691" onclick="highlightReply(50691)" href="/thread/50550.html#50691">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50691)" href="/thread/50550.html#q50691">50691</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >slavs are Indo-European and white btw, you look 8/10</div></div><br/><br class="clear"/><hr/></div><div class="thread" id="thread_50690" data-board="a">    <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708914339780.jpg">1708914339780.jpg</a> <span class="unimportant">(381.76 KB, 720x1266, <span class="postfilename">bocchimindset.jpg</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708914339780.jpg" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708914339780.jpg" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708914339780.jpg" style="width:145px;height:255px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>    <div class="post op" id="op_50690" ><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50690" id="delete_50690" /><label for="delete_50690"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-26T02:25:40Z">02/26/24 (Mon) 02:25:40</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50690" onclick="highlightReply(50690)" href="/thread/50690.html#50690">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50690)" href="/thread/50690.html#q50690">50690</a><a href="/thread/50690.html">[Reply]</a></p><div class="body">bocchibros&hellip;</div></div><br class="clear"/><hr/></div><div class="thread" id="thread_50644" data-board="a">    <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708898699655.jpg">1708898699655.jpg</a> <span class="unimportant">(85.84 KB, 698x456, <span class="postfilename">1686888908323.jpg</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708898699655.jpg" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708898699655.jpg" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708898699655.jpg" style="width:255px;height:167px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>    <div class="post op" id="op_50644" ><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50644" id="delete_50644" /><label for="delete_50644"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T22:05:00Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 22:05:00</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50644" onclick="highlightReply(50644)" href="/thread/50644.html#50644">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50644)" href="/thread/50644.html#q50644">50644</a><img class="icon" title="Locked" src="//soyjak.party/static/closed.png" alt="Locked" /><a href="/thread/50644.html">[Reply]</a></p><div class="body">4chan has just turned into "reddit but you can say nigger and pedophile without getting banned"<br/><br/>userbase has become more and more boring and tame over the years, entire boards turning into hugboxes, multiple anons will attack someone for saying anything incel-adjacent or anything against trannies in threads on any board at this point. i know its lame to whine about the internet being overtaken by technologically illiterate leftist normies like some old-web fetishist but i would have never thought 4chan could turn out this way.<br/><br/>browsing smaller imgboards while eating ramen is better for mental and physical well being, it is cathartic to rant on the internet goodnight sharty</div><span class="omitted">33 posts and 6 image replies omitted. Click reply to view.</span></div><div class="post reply" id="reply_50678"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50678" id="delete_50678" /><label for="delete_50678"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T22:32:58Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 22:32:58</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50678" onclick="highlightReply(50678)" href="/thread/50644.html#50678">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50678)" href="/thread/50644.html#q50678">50678</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" ><span class="quote">&gt;multiple anons will attack someone for saying anything incel-adjacent or anything against trannies in threads on any board at this point</span><br/>But how many of these troons were MAGA supporters once "deradicalizd" by sissy porn and how many are 'cord plants (refer to /v/'s moderation team)?</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50679"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50679" id="delete_50679" /><label for="delete_50679"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T22:33:33Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 22:33:33</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50679" onclick="highlightReply(50679)" href="/thread/50644.html#50679">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50679)" href="/thread/50644.html#q50679">50679</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >You can't even say nigger KEK</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50680"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50680" id="delete_50680" /><label for="delete_50680"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T22:35:33Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 22:35:33</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50680" onclick="highlightReply(50680)" h