0593)" href="/thread/50437.html#q50593">50593</a></p>        <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708857475308.png">1708857475308.png</a> <span class="unimportant">(18.74 KB, 626x774, <span class="postfilename">1688922857742.png</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708857475308.png" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708857475308.png" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708857475308.png" style="width:206px;height:255px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>         <div class="body" ><span class="quote">&gt;come on, guys, are you celebrating the deaths of people that died in a fire? crosses the line for me honestly</span></div></div><br/><br class="clear"/><hr/></div><div class="thread" id="thread_50325" data-board="a">    <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708281179227.png">1708281179227.png</a> <span class="unimportant">(88.31 KB, 1024x704, <span class="postfilename">ClipboardImage.png</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708281179227.png" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708281179227.png" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708281179227.png" style="width:255px;height:175px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>    <div class="post op" id="op_50325" ><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50325" id="delete_50325" /><label for="delete_50325"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-18T18:32:59Z">02/18/24 (Sun) 18:32:59</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50325" onclick="highlightReply(50325)" href="/thread/50325.html#50325">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50325)" href="/thread/50325.html#q50325">50325</a><a href="/thread/50325.html">[Reply]</a></p><div class="body">last night i watched all of jujutsu kaisen season 2 and it was actually quite mediocre, the first half is just some slice of life bullshit between gojo and geto and then after rika dies geto becomes a misanthrope and then its just 1 overextended fight scene after another. This tranime (like all the rest) is dogshit and the only reason why it's popular is because every other tranime that was famous like MHA or CSM is dead, JJK is the only one left alive and its gonna die soon. Stop watching tranime and get a better hobby like exercise or politics or something idk</div><span class="omitted">7 posts and 2 image replies omitted. Click reply to view.</span></div><div class="post reply" id="reply_50388"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50388" id="delete_50388" /><label for="delete_50388"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-20T17:01:35Z">02/20/24 (Tue) 17:01:35</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50388" onclick="highlightReply(50388)" href="/thread/50325.html#50388">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50388)" href="/thread/50325.html#q50388">50388</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >tsmt its the most generic copy paste shounenslop that normiecattle gobble up.</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50389"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50389" id="delete_50389" /><label for="delete_50389"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-20T17:56:44Z">02/20/24 (Tue) 17:56:44</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50389" onclick="highlightReply(50389)" href="/thread/50325.html#50389">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50389)" href="/thread/50325.html#q50389">50389</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" ><a onclick="highlightReply('50388', event);" href="/a/thread/50325.html#50388">&gt;&gt;50388</a><br/>holy twitter buzzworderald</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50393"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50393" id="delete_50393" /><label for="delete_50393"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-20T20:15:41Z">02/20/24 (Tue) 20:15:41</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50393" onclick="highlightReply(50393)" href="/thread/50325.html#50393">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50393)" href="/thread/50325.html#q50393">50393</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" >jjk is just trendy consoomer bs</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50547"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50547" id="delete_50547" /><label for="delete_50547"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-24T03:43:36Z">02/24/24 (Sat) 03:43:36</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50547" onclick="highlightReply(50547)" href="/thread/50325.html#50547">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50547)" href="/thread/50325.html#q50547">50547</a></p>        <div class="files">    </div>         <div class="body" ><a onclick="highlightReply('50367', event);" href="/a/thread/50325.html#50367">&gt;&gt;50367</a><br/>have fun<br/><a onclick="highlightReply('50388', event);" href="/a/thread/50325.html#50388">&gt;&gt;50388</a><br/><a onclick="highlightReply('50393', event);" href="/a/thread/50325.html#50393">&gt;&gt;50393</a><br/>truthnukes<br/><a onclick="highlightReply('50360', event);" href="/a/thread/50325.html#50360">&gt;&gt;50360</a><br/>mash banana button peanut walnut yay</div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50590"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50590" id="delete_50590" /><label for="delete_50590"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T07:06:25Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 07:06:25</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50590" onclick="highlightReply(50590)" href="/thread/50325.html#50590">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50590)" href="/thread/50325.html#q50590">50590</a></p>        <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708844784735.jpg">1708844784735.jpg</a> <span class="unimportant">(189.66 KB, 1024x1193, <span class="postfilename">your IQ.jpg</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708844784735.jpg" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708844784735.jpg" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708844784735.jpg" style="width:218px;height:255px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>         <div class="body" ><a onclick="highlightReply('50325', event);" href="/a/thread/50325.html#50325">&gt;&gt;50325</a><br/><span class="quote">&gt;This tranime (like all the rest) is dogshit and the only reason why it's popular is because every other tranime that was famous like MHA or CSM is dead, JJK is the only one left alive and its gonna die soon. Stop watching tranime and get a better hobby like exercise or politics or something idk</span><br/>erm keyed, personally i cant believe how many people eat this garbage up, had to watch it in 2x speed and i was still bored out of my mind, i dont understand how we are supposed to care about side character development when two of the main characters are goku level strong from episode 1.</div></div><br/><br class="clear"/><hr/></div><div class="thread" id="thread_50586" data-board="a">    <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708842186855.png">1708842186855.png</a> <span class="unimportant">(71.65 KB, 983x642, <span class="postfilename">yuricucks.png</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708842186855.png" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708842186855.png" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708842186855.png" style="width:255px;height:167px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>    <div class="post op" id="op_50586" ><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50586" id="delete_50586" /><label for="delete_50586"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T06:23:07Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 06:23:07</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50586" onclick="highlightReply(50586)" href="/thread/50586.html#50586">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50586)" href="/thread/50586.html#q50586">50586</a><a href="/thread/50586.html">[Reply]</a></p><div class="body">Why are yuricucks the most fragile group in tranime discussions?</div></div><div class="post reply" id="reply_50587"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50587" id="delete_50587" /><label for="delete_50587"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T06:46:47Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 06:46:47</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50587" onclick="highlightReply(50587)" href="/thread/50586.html#50587">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50587)" href="/thread/50586.html#q50587">50587</a></p>        <div class="files">            <div class="file"><p class="fileinfo">File: <a href="1708843606615.png">1708843606615.png</a> <span class="unimportant">(68.66 KB, 974x673, <span class="postfilename" title="Screenshot 2024-02-25 121357.png">Screenshot 2024-02-25 1213….png</span>)<span class='image_id'><a href="http://imgops.com/http://localhost1708843606615.png" target="_blank">ImgOps</a> </span></span></p><a href="1708843606615.png" target="_blank"><img class="post-image" src="1708843606615.png" style="width:255px;height:176px" alt="" /></a></div>    </div>         <div class="body" ></div></div><br/><div class="post reply" id="reply_50588"><p class="intro"><input type="checkbox" class="delete" name="delete_50588" id="delete_50588" /><label for="delete_50588"><span  class="name">Chud</span>  <time datetime="2024-02-25T06:50:54Z">02/25/24 (Sun) 06:50:54</time></label>&nbsp;<a class="post_no" id="post_no_50588" onclick="highlightReply(50588)" href="/thread/50586.html#50588">№</a><a class="post_no" onclick="citeReply(50588)" href="/thread/50586.html#q50588">50588</a></